5.022" end="15.592">Why</span> <span begin="15.592" end="16.253">do,</span> <span begin="16.691" end="16.792">you</span> <span begin="16.792" end="17.038">have</span> <span begin="17.038" end="17.651">to</span> <span begin="17.651" end="18.888">leave</span> <span begin="18.888" end="19.592">me?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为什么，为什么你一定要离开我</span></p><p begin="19.859" end="24.472" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.859" end="20.339">It</span> <span begin="20.339" end="21.022">seems,</span> <span begin="21.443" end="21.576">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="21.576" end="21.704">los</span><span begin="21.704" end="22.051">ing</span> <span begin="22.051" end="22.365">some</span><span begin="22.365" end="22.654">thing</span> <span begin="22.654" end="23.048">deep</span> <span begin="23.048" end="23.374">in</span><span begin="23.374" end="23.645">side</span> <span begin="23.645" end="23.950">of</span> <span begin="23.950" end="24.472">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉就像我失去了心里最深处的一部分</span></p><p begin="24.472" end="28.717" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.472" end="25.091">Hold</span> <span begin="25.091" end="25.800">on,</span> <span begin="26.275" end="26.867">on</span> <span begin="26.867" end="27.123">to</span> <span begin="27.123" end="28.717">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱紧我吧</span></p><p begin="28.717" end="33.438" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.717" end="29.309">Now</span> <span begin="29.309" end="29.549">I</span> <span begin="29.549" end="30.557">see,</span> <span begin="31.091" end="31.693">now</span> <span begin="31.693" end="31.923">I</span> <span begin="31.923" end="33.438">see</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">现在我才明白</span></p><p begin="33.438" end="37.590" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.438" end="34.000">Every</span><span begin="34.000" end="34.624">body</span> <span begin="34.624" end="35.179">hurts</span> <span begin="35.179" end="35.803">some</span> <span begin="35.803" end="37.590">days</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人终有一天都会遍体鳞伤</span></p><p begin="38.224" end="42.390" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.224" end="38.478">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="38.478" end="38.806">ok</span><span begin="38.806" end="39.088">ay</span> <span begin="39.088" end="39.392">to</span> <span begin="39.392" end="39.957">be</span> <span begin="39.957" end="40.464">a</span><span begin="40.464" end="42.390">fraid</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">觉得害怕也没关系</span></p><p begin="42.944" end="44.646" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.944" end="43.472">Every</span><span begin="43.472" end="43.995">body</span> <span begin="43.995" end="44.646">hurts</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人都会受伤</span></p><p begin="45.259" end="47.275" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.259" end="45.840">Every</span><span begin="45.840" end="46.278">body</span> <span begin="46.278" end="47.275">screams</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人都会疼得尖叫</span></p><p begin="47.595" end="50.742" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.595" end="48.134">Every</span><span begin="48.134" end="48.427">body</span> <span begin="48.427" end="49.323">feels</span> <span begin="49.323" end="50.118">this</span> <span begin="50.118" end="50.742">way</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每个人都会有这样的感觉</span></p><p begin="50.742" end="53.755" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.742" end="51.323">And</span> <span begin="51.323" end="51.680">that&apos;s</span> <span begin="51.680" end="52.560">ok</span><span begin="52.560" end="53.755">ay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">没关系的</span></p><p begin="54.518" end="58.376" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.518" end="54.822">La</span> <span begin="54.822" end="54.939">la</span> <span begin="54.939" end="55.323">la</span> <span begin="55.323" end="55.472">la</span> <span begin="55.472" end="56.027">la,</span> <span begin="56.027" end="56.304">it&apos;s</span> <span begin="56.304" end="57.187">ok</span><span begin="57.187" end="58.376">ay</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啦啦啦啦啦，没关系的</span></p><p begin="1:02.270" end="1:06.800" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.270" end="1:02.755">It</span> <span begin="1:02.755" end="1:03.427">feels,</span> <span begin="1:03.910" end="1:04.032">like</span> <span begin="1:04.032" end="1:04.149">noth</span><span begin="1:04.149" end="1:04.456">ing</span> <span begin="1:04.456" end="1:04.779">re</span><span begin="1:04.779" end="1:05.072">ally</span> <span begin="1:05.072" end="1:05.419">mat</span><span begin="1:05.419" end="1:05.723">ters</span> <span begin="1:05.723" end="1:05.910">any</span><span begin="1:05.910" end="1:06.800">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那感觉就像，什么都不再重要了</span></p><p begin="1:06.800" end="1:11.221" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.800" end="1:06.976">When</span> <span begin="1:06.976" end="1:07.605">you&apos;re</span> <span begin="1:07.605" end="1:08.267">gone,</span> <span begin="1:08.811" end="1:09.056">I</span> <span begin="1:09.056" end="1:09.707">can&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:09.707" end="1:11.221">breathe</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你离开的一瞬间我简直停止了呼吸</span></p><p begin="1:11.691" end="1:16.421" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.691" end="1:11.803">And</span> <span begin="1:11.803" end="1:12.283">I</span> <span begin="1:12.283" end="1:12.923">know,</span> <span begin="1:13.355" end="1:13.477">you</span> <span begin="1:13.477" end="1:13.621">nev</span><span begin="1:13.621" end="1:13.957">er</span> <span begin="1:13.957" end="1:14.283">meant</span> <span begin="1:14.283" end="1:14.448">to</span> <span begin="1:14.448" end="1:14.907">make</span> <span begin="1:14.907" end="